OL,3,A'Anger in the streets': Tens of
OL,4,Athousands protest in Spain over housing
OL,5,Acrisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of people have
OL,8,Fprotested across Spain calling for
OL,9,Fgreater protections for tenants after
OL,10,Fthe government failed to pass emergency
OL,11,Fhousing legislation.
OL,13,FAbout 50 marches took place on Saturday
OL,14,Fin cities including Madrid, Valencia
OL,15,Fand Barcelona.
OL,17,F"There is a lot of anger in the
OL,18,Fstreets," a spokesperson for the
OL,19,FValencia Tenants' Union said. Clashes
OL,20,Fhave taken place between some
OL,21,Fprotesters and police in the city.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
